{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Logo_Animated.gif?t=1743538462\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Dungeons, find loot, customize your character and face monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Header_About.png?t=1743538462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where monsters were banished long ago, <i>something</i> has caused them to reemerge, and it's up to you, <strong>the Hero</strong>, to rid the world of monsters and defeat the <strong>Great Eternal Dragon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Mori</strong> is a game inspired by the classic <i>Dungeon Crawlers</i> and\u00a0<i>Old School</i>\u00a0<i>RPGs</i>. With a simple, yet addicting gameplay, it features a turn based battle system combined with a choice based dungeon exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Header_Explore.png?t=1743538462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Gif_Exploration.gif?t=1743538462\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve inside the Dungeons to find riches and loot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the dungeons to the end and fight a boss, or leave early to secure your earned rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>12 different dungeons</strong> to discover and explore, who knows what will you find inside them?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Header_Battle.png?t=1743538462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Gif_Combat.gif?t=1743538462\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Battle plethora of monsters, with each dungeon having their distinct variety!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 50 unique enemies</strong>, each one featuring their own lore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A complete <strong>Bestiary</strong> with useful information about the monsters, can you find and catalogue all of them?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Header_Customize.png?t=1743538462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/Gif_CharCreation.gif?t=1743538462\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your character appearance!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring <strong>over 8 classes</strong> and <strong>8 different races</strong> to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire <strong>rare gear</strong> and equip your character with <strong>powerful weapons</strong> or show your sense of fashion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your <strong>pet</strong> and take him to assist you in battle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who knows what awaits in your adventure? <strong>Enter the dungeons and find out!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597590?t=1743538462","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/b8f4dbdfe0a44717df65371aff0450c6cbdf0d52/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743538462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/9c4c2bf8e479e89f938af0d2c411bf31f89e2e6d/capsule_231x87